..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : KDINFO.BULOP.BN
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Funktion       : Zeigt die Details zum Saldo des Partners an.
.. Ablauf         : Button-nach-EFOP
..
.. Functionality  : Shows outstanding items of the partner
.. Program flow   : After button efop
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END  ? G|evtvar <> "bulop1" & G|evtvar <> "bulop2"
..
.. Declarations
.type ID87:9 xcallparam
..
.continue STAFFER ? M|istsachkd
..
.copy U|xcallparam = M|origlopaufparam
.continue EXECUTE
..
!STAFFER
.copy U|xcallparam = M|sachlopaufparam
..
!EXECUTE
.continue END ? F|empty(U|xcallparam)
.input "st/CALLPARAM.EXEC"
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
